.TH GPT2CODEX-GUI 1 "October 2026" "0.1.0~alpha1"
.SH NAME
gpt2codex-gui \- Qt6 views of registered persistent terminal sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpt2codex-gui
.RI [ --bridge-cli " /absolute/gpt2codex" ]
.RI [ --config " /absolute/config.toml" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides Konsole KPart and QTermWidget terminal views independently of the
session multiplexer. It only attaches verified existing sessions; it never
starts or automatically restarts Codex.
.SH SAFE PROBES
--self-test performs read-only validation without attaching terminals.
--backend-probe reports which installed modules are usable.
--settings-probe reports GUI preferences. Probes still need a Qt platform;
use QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen for headless verification.
.SH PROJECT ICONS
A regular .icon.png in a registered root supplies its tab icon.
Symlinks, images larger than 1 MiB or 1024 by 1024 pixels, and unusable PNGs
fall back to theme icons. The tooltip shows the root and actual multiplexer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpt2codex (1)
